                                "sense_id": "ea5964de-d36b-3f2e-94d1-715a633bc789",
                                "text": "‘And you, Sir knight,’ / (Said she) ‘that taken have this toylesome paine / For wretched woman […]!’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcaf0d8d-8ff1-498c-9444-748b1f0f8c00",
                                "sense_id": "ea5964de-d36b-3f2e-94d1-715a633bc789",
                                "text": "The whole of the interior of South Africa is, of course, one vast plateau at a considerable elevation, and all the main lines coming up from the coast have some toilsome climbing."
                            }
                        ]
